Also require, at
every fixed `d_sep`,

`ratio(w_C,w_D,d_sep)≤ratio(1,1,d_sep)+10^-12`

for all `w_C,w_D∈{1,2,3}`.  **Red `--red-c1b`:** replace the rate by
