+
+## ⟨1⟩3. Incoming and outgoing transforms
+
+**ASSUME.** ⟨1⟩2 and D7.  **PROVE.** The stationary maps in ⟨1⟩1 are
+isometries with physical scattering multiplier `S_phys`.
