+STATUS: PARTIAL
+
+- Read gate complete; constructing `ml1.md` and `ml6.md` in this lane only.
+- Target: unconditional D6 infinite-chain one-/two-magnon scattering spaces, fixed-packet wave operators, and ordered soft-limit contamination bounds.
