+
+*Justification.* Claims `S-general`, `ML2`, `ML3`, `ML4`, and
+`S-IDX-MATCH-HS-SEP`.
+
+**⟨2⟩3.**  Steps ⟨1⟩2--⟨1⟩3 isolate and remove the contaminating spectral
+coefficients, ⟨1⟩4 fixes their order of removal, ⟨1⟩5 takes the soft limit in
