+
+*Justification.* Named computation `ml1_ml6_check.py`; recorded output
+`ml1_ml6_check.out`.
+
+**⟨2⟩3.**  This certificate tests none of wave-operator existence,
+finite-volume spectral convergence, `(SEP)`, or the limit order; those are
